----------------------------------------------------------------------

Beat annotations, per-stem metrics CSVs, and crowd-tapping derivatives in
`data/` are released under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Audio excerpts are NOT redistributed by this repository, with one exception:
`audio_demos/` ships eight short case-study demonstrations, each covering a
15-second window of a research-corpus excerpt with a click track mixed over the
music, included so that the §3.6 cases can be heard. That music remains
copyrighted by its original publishers, as does the audio behind every other
excerpt in the dataset; please obtain full audio from the source corpora cited
in the paper.
